  "narrative": "No new validation result was due in this synthesis cycle, and no further voluntary validation request is possible because the validation budget is exhausted; previously delivered validation remains incorporated. The essential new scientific decision is the direction and status of feature_002. The original H257 hypothesis claimed that feature_002=1 lowers outcome_001 in a clean context after excluding feature_010, feature_037, feature_003, and feature_063. Under the direction-signed convention, its evidence R175 was -0.795 [-0.836,-0.755], meaning the raw association is opposite to the claimed lowering direction. I therefore reject H257. I accept the registered reversed feature_002 contrasts H281-H284 because their direction-signed estimates are far above the 0.15 composite dependency-score-unit practical threshold: clean residual contrast +0.795 [0.755,0.836] (R175), nonnegative feature_038 context +0.819 [0.764,0.874] (R191), negative feature_038 context +0.777 [0.718,0.837] (R192), and after excluding feature_010 and feature_037 +0.784 [0.736,0.833] (R181). The consistent sign across contexts makes the original feature_002 lowering claims incorrect, while the accepted interpretation is dataset-specific: feature_002=1 is associated with higher outcome_001, i.e., a less negative composite dependency score and therefore weaker measured dependency. This remains unadjusted, unvalidated, and possibly reflecting coding, derived structure, or latent proxy structure. The non-feature_002 architecture remains robust: feature_037 is the strongest lowering predictor, including after excluding feature_002 and after excluding multiple dominant axes, and feature_010 is a conditional reversal predictor whose positive and negative quadrant effects persist without feature_002. Localized feature_003 lowering in high-feature_036 contexts persists, and localized feature_063 lowering in feature_038-positive clean contexts persists. I also reject broad nonlocalized feature_003 contrasts H13, H97, and H98 because their point estimates are below the threshold and their intervals do not establish a scientifically meaningful lowering effect in the tested contrasts. This does not weaken the localized high-feature_036 feature_003 findings. Supported findings are therefore: feature_037 as the primary lowering axis; feature_010 conditional positive overall but strongly negative in feature_038/feature_018 nonnegative or high contexts, with several independently validated interactions; feature_003 lowering localized mainly to high-feature_036 contexts and not a broad uniform effect; feature_063 lowering context-dependent, strongest in feature_038-positive and feature_037-clean settings; and feature_002 strong positive/higher-outcome association as a new residual dataset-specific axis. Negative findings include many tested predictors and categorical contrasts with intervals near zero or below threshold. Unresolved uncertainty is dominated by feature_002: whether it is independent, correlated with dominant axes, a coding artifact, or a modifier of the accepted architecture; H118 remains borderline; and several rarer feature_063 or interaction contexts remain imprecise. The most informative next analysis is to prioritize the registered feature_002-organizing follow-ups, especially feature_037 lowering among feature_002=1, feature_010 positive contrasts with and without feature_002, feature_010 reversal within feature_002-defined strata, and feature_003/feature_063 patterns among feature_002 strata after removing dominant axes. All conclusions remain dataset-specific unadjusted associations and do not establish causality, mechanism, gene/pathway meaning, single-gene knockout biology, or external generalizability.",
  "research_notes": "Iteration 16 synthesize. Rejected H257 and accepted reversed feature_002 claims H281-H284: feature_002=1 is associated with higher outcome_001, i.e. weaker measured composite dependency, in clean and feature_038-context contrasts. Rejected broad nonmeaningful feature_003 contrasts H13, H97, H98. Core architecture remains supported and robust to feature_002 exclusion: feature_037 strongest lowering predictor; feature_010 conditional positive overall with strong negative reversal in feature_038/feature_018 nonnegative/high contexts; feature_003 localized high-feature_036 lowering; feature_063 context-dependent lowering strongest in feature_038-positive feature_037-clean settings. Feature_002 is now the largest unresolved axis because it is large, consistent, unvalidated, and possibly coding/proxy related. Validation budget exhausted. Next prioritize feature_002 stratified follow-ups: feature_037 among feature_002, feature_010 with and without feature_002, feature_010 reversal stratified by feature_002, and feature_003/feature_063 patterns among feature_002 strata. All conclusions remain unadjusted dataset-specific associations, noncausal, nonmechanistic, non-gene-specific, and not externally generalizable."
